config BR2_PACKAGE_FROST_STRESS
	bool "frost-stress"
	help
	  Boot-time userspace stress: a timer/signal storm, vfork/exec,
	  futex ping-pong over MAP_SHARED, two-process LR/SC contention,
	  and cycles/instret/time/ipc_x1000 deltas around a fixed workload.
	  QEMU reports counters=unavailable because Zicntr is not U-readable.
	  QEMU CI and the hardware soak check
	  FROST_USERSPACE_STRESS_PASS/_FAIL.
